commit 50f2edf1914caeddce15745d4cea1ea5fd8a6d51
Author: Tolga Unal <115488770+unaltolga@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Mon Nov 9 11:53:01 2026 -0500

    Keep the space after a bare time in the Zonos2 normalizer (#387)
    
    The time pattern ended with \s* before the optional am/pm group, so a
    time without am/pm consumed the space after it: "Meet at 3:30 tomorrow."
    became "Meet at three thirtytomorrow.". Move the whitespace into the
    optional group, as Neywa-Labs/mlx-audio#1131 does for the Python
    normalizer.

diff --git a/Sources/MLXAudioTTS/Models/Zonos2/Zonos2Text.swift b/Sources/MLXAudioTTS/Models/Zonos2/Zonos2Text.swift
